    [CI] Make daily nightly image tags unique and align nightly-with-base inputs (#19093)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    - .github/workflows/_nightly_image_build.yaml: append -r to the daily
    nightly tag so same-day rebuilds no longer overwrite each other (or get
    overwritten in the green region after the blue->green SWR sync), and
    keep the date-only tag as a moving alias. Release tags stay stable.
    - .github/workflows/schedule_nightly_image_build_with_base.yaml: add a
    cann [url, version] input mirroring schedule_image_build_and_push.yaml,
    drop cann_version from base_image_tag, refresh the
    CANN/memcache/memfabric/torch_npu/triton-ascend defaults (plus the
    inline || '...' fallbacks), and expose the pair workflow's existing
    skip_base input from this entry point.
    - .github/workflows/_schedule_nightly_pair_image_build.yaml: accept an
    optional cann_swr_url override (empty keeps the previous
    registry/build-type default).
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
